/* Touch (0206): on a touch screen the demo's controls reach 44px without changing the desktop
   look: chips, buttons, steps and rows grow to 44px tall, a swatch grows an invisible margin,
   and the slider's thumb is a 24×32 target around its 8×16 block. A swatch's margin reaches 4px
   sideways, half the 8px gap: at 10px the two plates' targets overlapped and the dark one took
